                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a fun little tactics game.\n\nIf you like the combat in games like Rimworld, then think of this as a set of scripted missions using that sort of gameplay.\nMissions can be tackled in a variety of ways, and your gang members have unique talents and abilities that you can upgrade as they level up. I particularly liked the \"pocket sand\" ability, that lets you blind enemies within a certain cone.\n\nOn normal difficulty the game is not particularly difficult, I ended up completing the campaign losing only 2 gang members, while using the same 4 gang members to complete most missions. That said I did make thorough use of the \"tactics mode\" which lets you pause time and plan out your actions carefully.\n\nCompleting the enjoyable campaign on normal difficulty took me a good 6 hours, I feel it's worth the price.",
